{
  "app_id": 3257150,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "In RoboGAL: Gaga Delta Lady you'll help Rei-Bo investigate a spaceship that has crash-landed on Plutobell which will be full of all kinds of traps and enemies! Jump, shoot and slide to overcome all the obstacles in the game. Here you'll be free to choose where on the spaceship you start! Each stage will have unique visuals, traps and unique enemies. Choose which challenge suits you best! At the end of each stage you'll face one of the bosses in the game. Defeat each of them and get their weapons which will help make many of the challenges much easier. A tip: Each boss contains a weakness that will make the battle easier! RoboGAL is designed to please those looking for a good challenge, but there will also be room for those who are learning. We've made a challenge that's just right for both those who want a more casual experience and 2D game veterans!"
  },
